 door wiped my memory. The door, Paula. That sounds like an excuse, not an explanation. Next you'll tell me the stairs stole my keys.","words":[{"w":"So","s":98.734,"e":98.915},{"w":"the","s":98.915,"e":99.075},{"w":"door","s":99.075,"e":99.315},{"w":"wiped","s":99.315,"e":99.715},{"w":"my","s":99.715,"e":99.955},{"w":"memory.","s":99.955,"e":100.595},{"w":"The","s":100.835,"e":100.995},{"w":"door,","s":100.995,"e":101.555},{"w":"Paula.","s":101.555,"e":102.355},{"w":"That","s":102.515,"e":102.755},{"w":"sounds","s":102.755,"e":103.075},{"w":"like","s":103.075,"e":103.315},{"w":"an","s":103.315,"e":103.475},{"w":"excuse,","s":103.475,"e":104.115},{"w":"not","s":104.115,"e":104.355},{"w":"an","s":104.355,"e":104.595},{"w":"explanation.","s":104.595,"e":105.395},{"w":"Next","s":105.795,"e":106.035},{"w":"you'll","s":106.035,"e":106.355},{"w":"tell","s":106.355,"e":106.515},{"w":"me","s":106.515,"e":106.595},{"w":"the","s":106.595,"e":106.835},{"w":"stairs","s":106.835,"e":107.155},{"w":"stole","s":107.155,"e":107.475},{"w":"my","s":107.475,"e":107.635},{"w":"keys.","s":107.635,"e":107.955}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":108.554,"end":119.05,"text":"It's not an excuse, it's an event boundary. Crossing the threshold tells your brain: new scene, new rules. The shopping list from the old scene gets archived.","words":[{"w":"It's","s":108.554,"e":108.87},{"w":"not","s":108.87,"e":109.03},{"w":"an","s":109.03,"e":109.27},{"w":"excuse,","s":109.27,"e":109.99},{"w":"it's","s":110.07,"e":110.23},{"w":"an","s":110.23,"e":110.39},{"w":"event","s":110.39,"e":110.79},{"w":"boundary.","s":110.79,"e":111.51},{"w":"Crossing","s":111.67,"e":112.07},{"w":"the","s":112.07,"e":112.31},{"w":"threshold","s":112.31,"e":112.79},{"w":"tells","s":112.79,"e":113.19},{"w":"your","s":113.19,"e":113.35},{"w":"brain:","s":113.35,"e":113.99},{"w":"new","s":114.15,"e":114.39},{"w":"scene,","s":114.39,"e":115.03},{"w":"new","s":115.03,"e":115.35},{"w":"rules.","s":115.35,"e":116.07},{"w":"The","s":116.1