"e":132.205},{"w":"our","s":132.205,"e":132.365},{"w":"second","s":132.365,"e":132.765},{"w":"expression,","s":132.765,"e":133.485},{"w":"and","s":133.645,"e":133.805},{"w":"honestly,","s":133.805,"e":134.525},{"w":"it's","s":134.525,"e":134.845},{"w":"perfect","s":134.845,"e":135.245},{"w":"here.","s":135.245,"e":135.485}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":136.064,"end":139.036,"text":"Did I? I wasn't even trying to be educational.","words":[{"w":"Did","s":136.11,"e":136.35},{"w":"I?","s":136.35,"e":136.91},{"w":"I","s":136.91,"e":137.15},{"w":"wasn't","s":137.15,"e":137.47},{"w":"even","s":137.47,"e":137.63},{"w":"trying","s":137.63,"e":137.95},{"w":"to","s":137.95,"e":138.03},{"w":"be","s":138.03,"e":138.19},{"w":"educational.","s":138.19,"e":139.036}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":139.336,"end":149.089,"text":"When something slips your mind, you simply forget it, usually something you meant to do. It slides away quietly, like a fish through your fingers.","words":[{"w":"When","s":139.336,"e":139.63},{"w":"something","s":139.63,"e":140.11},{"w":"slips","s":140.11,"e":140.51},{"w":"your","s":140.51,"e":140.75},{"w":"mind,","s":140.75,"e":141.23},{"w":"you","s":141.23,"e":141.39},{"w":"simply","s":141.39,"e":141.79},{"w":"forget","s":141.79,"e":142.11},{"w":"it,","s":142.11,"e":142.59},{"w":"usually","s":142.91,"e":143.39},{"w":"something","s":143.39,"e":143.79},{"w":"you","s":143.79,"e":144.03},{"w":"meant","s":144.03,"e":144.27},{"w":"to","s":144.27,"e":144.43},{"w":"do.","s":144.43,"e":144.99},{"w":"It","s":145.39,"e":145.55},{"w":"slides","s":145.55,"e":145.95},{"w":"away","s":145.95,"e":146.35},{"w":"quietly,","s":146.35,"e":147.15},{"w":"like","s":147.23,"e":147.39},{"w":"a","s":147.39,"e":147.55},{"w":"fish","s":147.55,"e":147.87},{"w":"through","s":147.87,"e":148.19},{"w":"your","s":148.19,"e":148.35},{"w":"fingers.","s":148.35,"e":148.75}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":149.389,"end":156.308,"text":"So a birthday can slip your mind, an appointment can slip your mind. It's gentle forgetting, not dramatic amnesia.","words":[{"w":"So","s":149.389,"e":149.555},{"w":"a","s":149.555,"e":149.715},{"w":"birthday","s":149.715,"e":150.115},{"w":"can","s":150.115,"e":150.355},{"w":"slip","s":150.355,"e":150.595},{"w":"your","s":150.595,"e":150.835},{"w":"mind,","s":150.835,"e":151.395},{"w":"an","s":151.555,"e":151.795},{"w":"appointment","s":151.795,"e":152.275},{"w":"can","s":152.275,"e":152.515},{"w":"slip","s":152.515,"e":152.755},{"w":"your","s":152.755,"e":152.915},{"w":"mind.","s":152.915,"e":153.475},{"w":"It's","s":153.475,"e":153.875},{"w":"gentle","s":153.875,"e":154.275},{"w":"forgetting,","s":154.275,"e":154.915},{"w":"not","s":154.915,"e":155.155},{"w":"dramatic","s":155.155,"e":155.635},{"w":"amnesia.","s":155.635,"e":156.308}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":156.608,"end":164.503,"text":"Exactly. And notice the grammar: the forgotten thing is the subject. It slipped my mind, not I slipped.","words":[{"w":"Exactly.","s":156.608,"e":157.475},{"w":"And","s":157.555,"e":157.715},{"w":"notice","s":157.715,"e":158.115},{"w":"the","s":158.115,"e":158.355},{"w":"grammar:","s":158.355,"e":159.075},{"w":"the","s":159.075,"e":159.315},{"w":"forgotten","s":159.315,"e":159.795},{"w":"thing","s":159.795,"e":160.195},{"w":"is","s":160.195,"e":160.435},{"w":"the","s":160.435,"e":160.675},{"w":"subject.","s":160.675,"e":161.315},{"w":"It","s":161.795,"e":161.955},{"w":"slipped","s":161.955,"e":162.355},{"w":"my","s":162.355,"e":162.595},{"w":"mind,","s":162.595,"e":163.155},{"w":"not","s":163.155,"e":163.555},{"w":"I","s":163.555,"e":163.795},{"w":"slipped.","s":163.795,"e":164.275}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":164.803,"end":172.559,"text":"Good, because I do enough slipping in real life. Now explain the sofa magic. Why did everything come back when you sat down?","words":[{"w":"Good,","s":164.803,"e":165.49},{"w":"because","s":165.49,"e":165.73},{"w":"I","s":165.73,"e":165.89},{"w":"do","s":165.89,"e":166.05},{"w":"enough","s":166.05,"e":166.37},{"w":"slipping","s":166.37,"e":166.69},{"w":"in","s":166.69,"e":166.85},{"w":"real","s":166.85,"e":167.09},{"w":"life.","s":167.09,"e":167.65},{"w":"Now","s":167.97,"e":168.29},{"w":"explain","s":168.29,"e":168.69},{"w":"the","s":168.69,"e":168.85},{"w":"sofa","s":168.85,"e":169.25},{"w":"magic.","s":169.25,"e":169.89},{"w":"Why","s":170.13,"e":170.37},{"w":"did","s":170.37,"e":170.61},{"w":"everything","s":170.61,"e":171.01},{"w":"come","s":171.01,"e":171.25},{"w":"back","s":171.25,"e":171.41},{"w":"when","s":171.41,"e":171.65},{"w":"you","s":171.65,"e":171.81},{"w":"sat","s":171.81,"e":172.05},{"w":"down?","s":172.05,"e":172.559}]},{"speaker":"Paula","start":172.959,"end":182.99,"text":"That's the practical trick. Returning to the room where you had the thought reopens the file. Same walls, same chair, same mental scene.","words":[{"w":"That's","s":172.959,"e":173.33},{"w":"the","s":173.33,"e":173.49},{"w":"practical","s":173.49,"e":174.05},{"w":"trick.","s":174.05,"e":174.61},{"w":"Returning","s":174.93,"e":175.41},{"w":"to","s":175.41,"e":175.65},{"w":"the","s":175.65,"e":175.81},{"w":"room","s":175.81,"e":176.13},{"w":"where","s":176.13,"e":176.53},{"w":"you","s":176.53,"e":176.69},{"w":"had","s":176.69,"e":176.93},{"w":"the","s":176.93,"e":177.09},{"w":"thought","s":177.09,"e":177.57},{"w":"reopens","s":177.57,"e":178.21},{"w":"the","s":178.21,"e":178.37},{"w":"file.","s":178.37,"e":178.69},{"w":"Same","s":179.545,"e":179.945},{"w":"walls,","s":179.945,"e":180.665},{"w":"same","s":180.665,"e":180.985},{"w":"chair,","s":180.985,"e":181.625},{"w":"same","s":181.625,"e":181.865},{"w":"mental","s":181.865,"e":182.345},{"w":"scene.","s":182.345,"e":182.985}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":183.29,"end":190.209,"text":"So the cure for the doorway is more doorways. Walk back through, and the brain goes, ah yes, the scissors.","words":[{"w":"So","s":183.29,"e":183.465},{"w":"the","s":183.465,"e":183.625},{"w":"cure","s":183.625,"e":183.945},{"w":"for","s":183.945,"e":